  "description": "“I’m going to do this for the last time, so let me go back with my memories.”\n\nThose who died for me 29 times.... I wanted to protect you with my own hands at least once. I want to protect those poor and pitiful 'my people'.\n\nThus, Elysia's 30th and last regression began. Everything began to change as if fate had been twisted into place. A child who was born without a ‘sign’ in a family that received God’s protection and lived a harsh life. I gradually realize that the beginning of the curse disguised as God's blessing all started with one person...\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
